/// Optional. Use Quality tuning level to choose how many transcoding passes
/// MediaConvert does with your video. When you choose Multi-pass, your
/// video quality is better and your output bitrate is more accurate. That
/// is, the actual bitrate of your output is closer to the target bitrate
/// defined in the specification. When you choose Single-pass, your encoding
/// time is faster. The default behavior is Single-pass.
pub enum AvcIntraUhdQualityTuningLevel: Str {
  SinglePass = "SINGLE_PASS"
  MultiPass = "MULTI_PASS"
  Unknown(value: Str)
}

